  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。おだやかな青色の　チェック柄で食卓を　さわやかに　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "두꺼운 천으로 만든 튼튼한 테이블보. 평온한 파란색 체크무늬로 식탁을 시원하게 만들어 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "質地厚實，牢固耐用的桌巾。象徵安穩的藍色格紋為餐桌帶來清新的氣息。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe résistante coupée dans un tissu épais. Le motif bleu à carreaux reposant apporte de la douceur à n’importe quelle table.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein robustes Tischtuch aus dickem Stoff. Mit seinem sanften blauen Karomuster zaubert es ein gewisses Gefühl von Ruhe auf den Esstisch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hecho de un material grueso y resistente, este mantel a cuadros de un suave color azul aporta una sensación de calma a cualquier mesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia robusta realizzata in tessuto spesso. Il suo motivo a scacchi di un bel viola delicato trasforma la tavola donandole serenità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sturdy tablecloth made of thick fabric. The gentle blue plaid gives a table a crisp look.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。おだやかな青色の　チェック柄で食卓を　さわやかに　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以厚重布料制作的结实桌巾。其宁静温和的蓝色格子图案，能让食桌摇身变得神清气爽。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
